/: RTL AOC Verification Workflow
/: Generates AOC schemas from ISA specs, then verifies RTL traces against them
/: STATUS: Draft - needs compilation

<- verification report
    <= combine AOC definitions, validity, trace, and per-cycle verification into report
    
    /: ============================================================
    /: PHASE 1: AOC Schema Generation
    /: ============================================================
    
    <- AOC definitions
        <= select the final AOC schema as output
        
        /: Ground inputs: Load specification files
        <- ISA spec text
